  Whoa, whoa whoa!  I never said I wasn't interested in the project,
nor did I meant to imply that about others.  I was talking
specifically about one  or two points (capitalization in particular,
and to a lesser extent, the period at the beginning of sentences in
front of an rather than the end of setnences) that seemed to be a very
large sticking point for almost everyone, with people on both sides
