entrenched in their positions.  You've listened to our positions, and
you are going to make your decision one way or the other by ultimately
whatever criteria you judge best.  Those are the realities.  I think
everyone is pretty much on your side with regards to other punctuation
issues, (at least for purposes of this project), which are basically
treated neutrally withing lojban.

